## API keys, environment configs — never commit these
*.xcconfig
!**/SharedSettings/*.xcconfig
Secrets/
.env
.env.*
!tools/plaid-sandbox-broker/.env.example

# Private evidence lives outside iCloud-synced folders (~/.nomadfi-private);
# this path is a symlink to it, so match it without a trailing slash.
docs/research/PlaidValidationEvidence

# ===========================
# Private docs (sensitive, not public-safe)
# ===========================
## Owner-only testbed document. Remains on disk for local reference
## but is no longer tracked. Existing commits still contain it on the
## public remote — this entry only prevents future changes from
## being pushed.
docs/ARIEL.md

## Local working copy of the FinanceKit capability request answers.
## Kept on disk for resubmission but never pushed.
docs/financekit-application.md

# Local agent/editor settings
.claude/

# Localization catalogs are source files and should stay version controlled.
!**/*.xcstrings

# Supabase CLI local state (project link cache)
**/supabase/.temp/
services/plaid-backend/.local-postgres.log
